  "_signal_note": "`patterns` name this document type and nothing else. `generic_patterns` are said by every contract in the family ('SURAT PERJANJIAN'), so they identify nothing on their own: a resolver with a FieldContext counts them at a fraction of the weight, and a resolver without one treats both lists alike, which is the behaviour the legacy engine is frozen at."
